 middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years, same as February to March. In 2025, November to December finished at 68% of normal and January to February at 168%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 55% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 20889 had its driest year in 1965 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
